abstract: "A draft Grants Charter and machine-readable decision-record assurance system for reconstructable ENS grant and service-provider decisions, including bounded evaluator provenance, source-byte binding, deterministic public projection, and a retrospective empirical corpus. Package version 0.4.0 is an unreleased engineering checkpoint; this metadata does not assert a v0.4.0 GitHub release, ENS endorsement, or a completed v1.0.0 assurance boundary."
repository-code: "https://github.com/fraware/ens-grant-decision-integrity"
